      "source": "To achieve that, the <code>MappingMongoConverter</code> uses a <code>MongoTypeMapper</code> abstraction with <code>DefaultMongoTypeMapper</code> as its main implementation.Its default behavior to store the fully qualified classname under <code>_class</code> inside the document.Type hints are written for top-level documents as well as for every value (if it is a complex type and a subtype of the declared property type).The following example (with a JSON representation at the end) shows how the mapping works:",
      "translation": "为了实现这一目标，<code>MappingMongoConverter</code> 使用 <code>MongoTypeMapper</code> 抽象类，其主要实现为 <code>DefaultMongoTypeMapper</code>。其默认行为是将完全限定类名存储在文档的 <code>_class</code> 字段中。类型提示不仅写入顶层文档，还会为每个值（如果它是复杂类型且是声明的属性类型的子类型）写入。以下示例（末尾附有 JSON 表示形式）展示了映射的工作原理：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data MongoDB stores the type information as the last field for the actual root class as well as for the nested type (because it is complex and a subtype of <code>Contact</code>).So, if you now use <code>mongoTemplate.findAll(Object.class, \"sample\")</code>, you can find out that the document stored is a <code>Sample</code> instance.You can also find out that the value property is actually a <code>Person</code>.",
      "translation": "Spring Data MongoDB 将类型信息存储为实际根类以及嵌套类型的最后一个字段（因为它是复杂的且是 `<code>Contact</code>` 的子类型）。因此，如果您现在使用 `<code>mongoTemplate.findAll(Object.class, \"sample\")</code>`，您可以发现所存储的文档是一个 `<code>Sample</code>` 实例。您还可以发现 `value` 属性实际上是一个 `<code>Person</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you want to avoid writing the entire Java class name as type information but would rather like to use a key, you can use the <code>@TypeAlias</code> annotation on the entity class.If you need to customize the mapping even more, have a look at the <code>TypeInformationMapper</code> interface.An instance of that interface can be configured at the <code>DefaultMongoTypeMapper</code>, which can, in turn, be configured on <code>MappingMongoConverter</code>.The following example shows how to define a type alias for an entity:",
      "translation": "如果您希望避免将整个 Java 类名作为类型信息写入，而更倾向于使用键值，则可以在实体类上使用<code>@TypeAlias</code>注解。如果需要进一步自定义映射关系，请查看<code>TypeInformationMapper</code>接口。<code>DefaultMongoTypeMapper</code>可以配置该接口的实例，而后者又可以在<code>MappingMongoConverter</code>上进行配置。以下示例展示了如何为实体定义类型别名：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the preceding example extends the <code>AbstractMongoClientConfiguration</code> class and overrides the bean definition of the <code>MappingMongoConverter</code> where we configured our custom <code>MongoTypeMapper</code>.",
      "translation": "请注意，上述示例扩展了 `<code>AbstractMongoClientConfiguration</code>` 类，并重写了 `<code>MappingMongoConverter</code>` 的 Bean 定义，在其中配置了我们自定义的 `<code>MongoTypeMapper</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the resulting document contains <code>pers</code> as the value in the <code>_class</code> Field.",
      "translation": "请注意，生成的文档中`_class`字段的值为`<code>pers</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows how to configure a custom <code>MongoTypeMapper</code> in <code>MappingMongoConverter</code>:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了如何在<code>MappingMongoConverter</code>中配置自定义的<code>MongoTypeMapper</code>：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "MongoDB collections can contain documents that represent instances of a variety of types.\nThis feature can be useful if you store a hierarchy of classes or have a class with a property of type <code>Object</code>.In the latter case, the values held inside that property have to be read in correctly when retrieving the object.Thus, we need a mechanism to store type information alongside the actual document.",
      "translation": "MongoDB 集合可以包含代表多种类型实例的文档。此功能在存储类层次结构或具有 <code>Object</code> 类型属性的类时非常有用。在后一种情况下，检索对象时必须正确读取该属性中持有的值。因此，我们需要一种机制来将类型信息与实际文档一起存储。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Type aliases only work if the mapping context is aware of the actual type.\nThe required entity metadata is determined either on first save or has to be provided via the configurations initial entity set.\nBy default, the configuration class scans the base package for potential candidates.",
      "translation": "类型别名仅在映射上下文知晓实际类型时才能生效。所需的实体元数据要么在首次保存时确定，要么必须通过配置类的初始实体集提供。默认情况下，配置类会扫描基础包以查找潜在候选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
